	(text "PCA9548A as on v1, TSSOP-24. Channel 0 = BATT 1, 1 = BATT 2, 2 = ADIRS (as in SF_OVHD.h);\nchannels 3-7 unused. Change from v1: R402/R403 pull the ATmega side up to +5V. The OLED side\nstays at +3V3 through R404-R409. SDA0-2, SCL0-2 and +3V3 leave on the ELEC and ADIRS ribbons."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
